lesson: 97
title: Days and weeks
stars: 0
explain: One week has 7 days. To turn weeks into days, multiply by 7, then add the extra days.
explain: 3 weeks and 4 days are 3 × 7 + 4 = 25 days.
vars: a=name w=2..9 d=2..6
answer: 7 * w + d
exercise: How many days are there in {w} weeks and {d} days?
exercise: {a}'s holiday lasts {w} weeks and {d} days. How many days is the holiday?
exercise: A plant needs {w} weeks and {d} days to flower. How many days is that?
exercise: {a} goes to camp for {w} weeks and {d} days. How many days does {a.he} spend at camp?
exercise: The school fair is {w} weeks and {d} days away. In how many days is the fair?
test: {a} reads a book for {d} days more than {w} weeks. How many days does {a.he} read it?
test: A ship sails for {w} whole weeks and then {d} more days. How long is the trip in days?
test: How many days pass in {w} weeks plus {d} days?
test: {a}'s grandmother stays for {w} weeks and {d} extra days. For how many days does she stay?
exercise: How many days make {w} weeks and {d} days?
exercise: {a} stays with {a.his} cousins for {w} weeks and {d} days. How many days does {a.he} stay?
exercise: {w} weeks {d} days. How many days in all?
exercise: The summer camp in Maine lasts {w} weeks and {d} days. How many days is the camp?
exercise: {a} trains for a race for {w.words} weeks and {d.words} days. For how many days does {a.he} train?
exercise: A chick hatches after {w} weeks and {d} days. How many days is that altogether?
exercise: Snow covers the hills of Scotland for {w} weeks and {d} days. For how many days is there snow?
exercise: {a}'s trip to Canada takes {w} weeks and {d} days. How long is the trip in days?
test: In days, how long are {d} days added to {w} weeks?
test: {a} looks after a neighbour's cat for {w} full weeks and {d} more days. How many days does {a.he} look after the cat?
test: A tent stands in a field in Wales for {d} days longer than {w} weeks. How many days does it stand there?
test: The school term in Australia has a break of {w} weeks and {d} days. How many days is the break?
test: {a} counts the time until a holiday in Ireland: {w} weeks and {d} days. How many days must {a.he} wait?
test: How many days long is a stay of {w} weeks plus {d} days in New Zealand?
exercise: {w} weeks n {d} days, how many days
exercise: {a}'s off for {w+1} weeks — no, {w} weeks and {d} days. days?
exercise: {a} says {w} weeks {d} days is {10*w+d} days lol. whats right
exercise: plant takes {w} weeks and {d} days to flower, we got 4 pots btw, how many days
test: holiday's {w} wks {d} days, in days that's how many
test: camp {w} weeks plus {d+1} days, sorry, {d} days. days total?
test: {a} counted {w+d} days for {w} weeks {d} days. nah. how many really
exam: Determine the total number of days comprised in a period of {w} weeks and {d} days.
exam: It is given that the holiday of {a} extends over {w.words} weeks and {d.words} days. Ascertain its duration in days.
exam: Whereas a course of study is of {w} weeks and {d} days' duration, state the said duration expressed in days.
exam: Compute the equivalent, in days, of an interval of {w} weeks augmented by {d} days.
exercise: Uncle Ray is "away", a guest of His Majesty, for {w} weeks and {d} days. How many days is he away?
exercise: After her procedure, Mum is laid up for {w} weeks and {d} days. How many days is she laid up?
test: my brother got "furloughed" for {w} weeks and {d} days, lazy sod's just playing games. how many days is that
